                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "today I got inspiration boost from my 3.5yo son\nwe went to a museum and there he saw several airplanes\nhe liked them a lot and we played some flight simulator \nI promised to him that at home I will setup to him similar app on a phone (on my phone)\nI searched in Android/Play store for a while and could not find anything appropriate\nI wanted arcade flight simulator without any ads or in game purchases\nafter 30 minutes of search I realized that I already have an arcade flight simulator\nan arcade"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " ",
                                "style": {
                                    "bold": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "dragon",
                                "style": {
                                    "bold": true,
                                    "italic": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " flight game that I made 2 years before he was born\n the game is free and has no ads\nso we played it and he liked it\nand I was like - \" I made this and this and that .. I made everything here\"\nso \"how is this relevant to this community?\"\n---- here is a punch line\nyeah graphics are outdated but I crafted it and my son loves it\nso this brings a "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "feelings ",
                                "style": {
                                    "bold": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "of computing, as a medium for an interactive storytelling\nand now i can craft with this new purpose in mind. \n\n-- P.S. I avoid adding link to the game,  but you can imagine a lowpoly reinterpretation of Spyro."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
