        "client_msg_id": "bbb596b4-c2d8-4d55-bece-827ff68cd3c3",
        "text": "Yeah, I'm right there with him...I dont really think we end up reading syntax either...the volume is just too high. I think we'll need new systems to be able to inspect and understand the systems we've built rather than relying on reading text (syntax or natural language even)",
